308 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 167 0 R
/E (Prior to getting married, I spent all my time with chronically homeless people. Usually they had addictions and mental health problems. I didn't exactly have a great strategy, but my thinking was that Jesus said to help the poor and that is what I ought to do. So I tried to be helpful. Sometimes this meant getting people food or warmer clothing or other things they needed. Sometimes it meant helping them get treatment or housing or medical care. But mostly it was just spending time with them and being interested in them like a friend.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
